      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Déconnexion"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Système"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That does not look like a Claude session key (it should start with sk-ant-sid).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce n’est pas une clé de session Claude (elle doit commencer par sk-ant-sid)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Claude Code credentials could not be read. Open Claude Code once, then retry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Impossible de lire les identifiants de Claude Code. Ouvrez Claude Code une fois, puis réessayez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Claude Code session is still expired. Run claude in Terminal, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La session Claude Code est toujours expirée. Lancez claude dans le Terminal, puis réessayez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Claude plan does not expose usage limits. Pro, Max or Team is required.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette offre Claude ne fournit pas de limites de consommation. Pro, Max ou Team est nécessaire."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This week": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette semaine"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This week: %lld%% used": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette semaine : %lld %% utilisés"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This week: %lld%% used, %lld%% projected at reset %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "This week: %1$lld%% used, %2$lld%% projected at reset %3$@"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette semaine : %1$lld %% utilisés, %2$lld %% prévus au reset %3$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This week: %lld%% used, blocked expected %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "This week: %1$lld%% used, blocked expected %2$@"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette semaine : %1$lld %% utilisés, blocage prévu %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This week: not enough readings yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette semaine : pas encore assez de relevés"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thresholds colour the gauge for weekly limits and before a forecast exists. Claude rate-limits usage requests: 3 minutes is a safe refresh.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les seuils colorent la jauge pour les limites hebdomadaires et avant qu'une prévision existe. Claude limite les requêtes d'usage : 3 minutes est une cadence sûre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utiliser"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Claude Code session": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utiliser la session Claude Code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use thresholds when no forecast exists": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utiliser les seuils quand aucune prévision n'existe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses undocumented Claude endpoints. Nothing leaves your Mac, but Anthropic may change or block them. Use at your own risk.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utilise des points d’accès Claude non documentés. Rien ne quitte votre Mac, mais Anthropic peut les modifier ou les bloquer. À utiliser à vos risques."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Version %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for approval in System Settings → General → Login Items.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En attente d’approbation dans Réglages Système → Général → Ouverture."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for the first reading…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En attente du premier relevé…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warning at %lld%%": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Attention à %lld %%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Weekly · %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hebdomadaire · %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Weekly, all models": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hebdomadaire, tous modèles"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Claude Code session has expired. Renew it here: Notch Usage asks Claude Code for a one-word reply, which counts as a tiny request. Or run claude in Terminal, or sign in with your browser.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre session Claude Code a expiré. Renouvelez-la ici : Notch Usage demande à Claude Code une réponse d'un mot, qui compte comme une toute petite requête. Ou lancez claude dans le Terminal, ou connectez-vous avec votre navigateur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Claude Code session has expired. Run claude in Terminal once to renew it: Notch Usage reconnects automatically.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre session Claude Code a expiré. Lancez claude une fois dans le Terminal pour la renouveler : Notch Usage se reconnecte seul."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your claude.ai session has expired. Sign in again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre session claude.ai a expiré. Reconnectez-vous."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "a question": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "une réponse"
